    "name": "Operator Unknown",
    "steam_appid": 3497680,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/534b2ab9e2c60102259b96211c3a6ffc.poster.avif?t=1751763397\" width=800 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/534b2ab9e2c60102259b96211c3a6ffc.webm?t=1751763397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/534b2ab9e2c60102259b96211c3a6ffc.mp4?t=1751763397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operator Unknown</strong> is an atmospheric analog horror game about guilt, memory, and control. After participating in a project by the IReCorp corporation, you find yourself trapped in a virtual loop of foreign minds. On the edge of reality and madness \u2014 fragmented memory files, mysterious entities, and a voice calling from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a sequence of distorted memories and digital nightmares. Explore forgotten places, decode hidden messages, and try to uncover the truth: Who is IReCorp \u2014 and is it too late to stop them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong><i>Warning: Game contains imagery that may be harmful to players with photosensitive epilepsy or similar condition.</i></strong><br><strong><i></i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/31183860a01c263de4d1e52f61697167.poster.avif?t=1751763397\" width=800 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/31183860a01c263de4d1e52f61697167.webm?t=1751763397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/31183860a01c263de4d1e52f61697167.mp4?t=1751763397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digital Nightmares</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live through fragmented memories in immersive first-person levels. Survive long enough by relying on your reflexes and wit. Watch every corner of the room you're locked in and listen closely for every whisper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Aesthetic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments with a unique artistic style and atmospheric storytelling. The town of Redwood has never looked so grim.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flesh and Fear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter supernatural entities lurking in the dark \u2014 some eerily familiar, others beyond comprehension... and possibly a few clowns to make things worse.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust the Corporation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the instructions of IReCorp \u2014 or try to break free from a hopeless prison of ones and zeroes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/b19c284cf1f642469526b0f576fddf84.poster.avif?t=1751763397\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/b19c284cf1f642469526b0f576fddf84.webm?t=1751763397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/b19c284cf1f642469526b0f576fddf84.mp4?t=1751763397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/534b2ab9e2c60102259b96211c3a6ffc.poster.avif?t=1751763397\" width=800 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/534b2ab9e2c60102259b96211c3a6ffc.webm?t=1751763397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/534b2ab9e2c60102259b96211c3a6ffc.mp4?t=1751763397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operator Unknown</strong> is an atmospheric analog horror game about guilt, memory, and control. After participating in a project by the IReCorp corporation, you find yourself trapped in a virtual loop of foreign minds. On the edge of reality and madness \u2014 fragmented memory files, mysterious entities, and a voice calling from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a sequence of distorted memories and digital nightmares. Explore forgotten places, decode hidden messages, and try to uncover the truth: Who is IReCorp \u2014 and is it too late to stop them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong><i>Warning: Game contains imagery that may be harmful to players with photosensitive epilepsy or similar condition.</i></strong><br><strong><i></i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/31183860a01c263de4d1e52f61697167.poster.avif?t=1751763397\" width=800 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/31183860a01c263de4d1e52f61697167.webm?t=1751763397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/31183860a01c263de4d1e52f61697167.mp4?t=1751763397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digital Nightmares</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live through fragmented memories in immersive first-person levels. Survive long enough by relying on your reflexes and wit. Watch every corner of the room you're locked in and listen closely for every whisper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Aesthetic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments with a unique artistic style and atmospheric storytelling. The town of Redwood has never looked so grim.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flesh and Fear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter supernatural entities lurking in the dark \u2014 some eerily familiar, others beyond comprehension... and possibly a few clowns to make things worse.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust the Corporation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the instructions of IReCorp \u2014 or try to break free from a hopeless prison of ones and zeroes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/b19c284cf1f642469526b0f576fddf84.poster.avif?t=1751763397\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/b19c284cf1f642469526b0f576fddf84.webm?t=1751763397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497680/extras/b19c284cf1f642469526b0f576fddf84.mp4?t=1751763397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
